(383, 'ReminderTextSummonAncestorKahuturoaSkill', '(Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Rongokurai tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which lets a percentage of your armour protect against all damage types)', ''),
(384, 'ReminderTextLesserShrineSkill', '(Creates a Lesser Shrine, which will grant a bonus when touched. The Lesser Shrine will disappear after a short duration, or when used)', ''),
(385, 'ReminderTextSpectralWolfSkill', '(Summons a spectral wolf companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral wolf grants you a buff that adds damage to your attacks. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead)', ''),
(386, 'ReminderTextVistingHarbingerOfTimeSkill', '(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally create an aura on you that increases the Action Speed of you and all allies near you)', ''),
(387, 'ReminderTextVistingHarbingerOfArcaneSkill', '(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion has two buff spells it will cast on you: Arcane Surge, granting increased Cast Speed and Mana Regeneration, and a buff that grants Chance to Shock and Lightning Penetration)', ''),
(388, 'ReminderTextVistingHarbingerOfFocusSkill', '(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. While you are channelling, the minion will occasionally cast a buff on you that reduces the Damage you take, makes you avoid all Stuns and Elemental Ailments, and prevents Curses affecting you)', ''),
(389, 'ReminderTextShadeFormSkill', '(Makes you immune to physical damage, and harder for enemies to detect, for a duration)', ''),
(390, 'ReminderTextAbberathsFurySkill', '(While you run, this skill creates a small explosion with each step, dealing fire damage in an area around you)', ''),
(391, 'ReminderTextRaiseSpidersSkill', '(Raise two spectral spiders from each nearby corpse that will attack your enemies with Viper Strike. Each raised spider grants you increased Attack Speed and increased Damage with Poison. Enemies will not engage the spiders directly, and they are immune to damage)', ''),
(392, 'ReminderTextGraceSkill', '(Casts an aura that grants evasion to you and your allies)', ''),
(393, 'ReminderTextEnvySkill', '(Casts an aura that adds chaos damage to the attacks and spells of you and your allies)', ''),
(394, 'ReminderTextDisciplineSkill', '(Casts an aura that grants additional energy shield and increased energy shield recharge rate to you and your allies)', ''),
(395, 'ReminderTextDeterminationSkill', '(Casts an aura that grants armour to you and your allies)', ''),
(396, 'ReminderTextAspectOfTheSpiderSkill', '(While active, periodically applies a Spider''s Web debuff to nearby Enemies, and Hinders them. Each Spider''s Web on an Enemy increases the Damage they take. Hinder reduces their movement speed. You can only have one Aspect active at a time)', ''),
(397, 'ReminderTextAspectOfTheCatSkill', '(While active, grants the Cat''s Stealth and Cat''s Agility buffs in sequence. Cat''s Stealth increases your critical strike chance, makes you harder to see, and gives you a chance to avoid damage for a short duration. Cat''s Agility increases your attack and cast speed for a longer secondary duration. You can only have one Aspect active at a time)', ''),
(398, 'ReminderTextAspectOfTheAvianSkill', '(While active, grants the Avian''s Might and Avian''s Flight buffs in sequence. Avian''s Might grants you and your minions a chance to deal Double Damage with hits for a duration. Avian''s Flight grants you and your minions increased Movement Speed for a secondary duration. You can only have one Aspect active at a time)', ''),
(399, 'ReminderTextProjectileCannotContinue', '(They cannot Split, Pierce, Fork, Chain, or Return if they collide with a target)', ''),
(400, 'ReminderTextLostShipment', '(Lost Shipments contain random rewards from Kalguuran or Karui ports)', ''),
(401, 'ReminderTextDivinationBuff', '(Divination Buffs are not Flask Effects, and you cannot have more than one at a time)', ''),
(402, 'ReminderTextExcommunicate', '(Excommunicated Enemies cannot deal Chaos Damage)', ''),
(403, 'ReminderTextMemoryStrands', '(When adding random explicit modifiers to this item, higher level modifiers will be more common proportional to the number of Memory Strands. Memory Strands are consumed whenever random explicit modifiers are added to this item)', ''),
(404, 'ReminderTextUnexciting', '(Unexciting things are rolled three times and the middle result used)', ''),
(405, 'ReminderTextGemRuin', '(Ruin applied by this method will stack additively with other sources of Ruin)', ''),
(406, 'ReminderTextMemoryLineCursed', '(Cursed areas penalise item drops, player experience and restrict certain content from appearing)', ''),
(407, 'ReminderTextKeystoneSacrificeOfBlood', '(Life Recovery from Regeneration grants Blood Barrier while on Full Life. Maximum Blood Barrier is equal to 30% of your Maximum Life. Damage from Hits is taken from Blood Barrier before your Life or Energy Shield. 50% less Life Regeneration Rate)', ''),
(408, 'ReminderTextWardShatter', '(Explodes when your Ward is broken, dealing Physical Spell Damage around you equal to a percentage of your Ward and inflicting Enervation on Hit, a debuff that lowers Movement Speed by 20% and prevents Life and Energy Shield Recovery for 4 seconds)', ''),
(409, 'ReminderTextGraftQuality', '(Graft Quality increases the amount of Hiveblood Stored)', ''),
(410, 'ReminderTextGhostTotems', '(Spectral Totems are intangible, untargetable, and undamageable, have 1 maximum Life, and cannot Taunt enemies. They are no longer counted as Summoned Totems, but modifiers that affect Totems also affect Spectral Totems)', ''),
(411, 'ReminderTextMania', '(Mania applies 4% increased Damage taken, 2% reduced Action Speed and 10% reduced Life and Energy Shield Recovery Rate for 15 seconds, and can be inflicted up to 15 times)', ''),
(412, 'ReminderTextFarrulsFarricPresence', '(Farrul''s Farric Presence is an Aura which grants 80% increased Accuracy Rating, 120% increased Critical Strike Chance and Take no Extra Damage from Critical Hits)', ''),
(413, 'ReminderTextFarrulsFertilePresence', '(Farrul''s Fertile Presence is an Aura which grants 100% increased Damage, Regenerate 3% of Life per second and Cannot be Stunned)', ''),
(414, 'ReminderTextFarrulsWildPresence', '(Farrul''s Wild Presence is an Aura which grants 20% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed and prevents Action Speed from being lowered below the Base Value)', ''),
(415, 'ReminderTextMistyReflection', '(Dash backwards, leaving a short-lived mist copy of yourself that Taunts nearby Enemies for a short duration. The copy can be damaged by Enemies, and copies that are killed by an Enemy will apply a debuff in an area that makes affected targets take 30% increased Damage and deal 30% less Damage for 4 seconds)', ''),
(416, 'ReminderTextLoneMessenger', '(You can only have one Herald
50% more Effect of Herald Buffs on you
100% more Damage with Hits from Herald Skills
50% more Damage Over Time with Herald Skills
Minions from Herald Skills deal 25% more Damage
Your Aura Skills are Disabled)', ''),
(417, 'ReminderTextAssassinsMarkSkill', '(Curses a single enemy, making them more vulnerable to Critical Strikes. Killing the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and a power charge. You can only have one Mark at a time)', ''),
(418, 'ReminderTextSpectralTigersSkill', '(Summons a spectral tiger companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral tiger grants you a buff that increases Critical Strike Chance, and increases Attack and Cast Speed. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead)', ''),
(419, 'ReminderTextEmbraceMadness', '(Grants Glorious Madness. While under Glorious Madness gain a random Touched Debuff every 2 seconds. Using this skill again will remove Glorious Madness and the Touched Debuffs it inflicts, but you will be unable to Embrace Madness again until the cooldown expires)', ''),
(420, 'ReminderTextPrismaticBulwark', '(Armour applies to Fire, Cold and Lightning Damage taken from Hits instead of Physical Damage
-15% to all maximum Elemental Resistances)', ''),
(421, 'ReminderTextRandomShrineDuration', '(Random Shrine buffs have a base duration of 20 seconds)', ''),
(422, 'ReminderTextUnholyMightDuration', '(Unholy Might grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage and 25% chance to apply Withered on Hit and lasts for 4 seconds)', ''),
(423, 'ReminderTextWildSavagery', '(Wild Savagery grants 100% increased Physical Damage, 10% increased Action Speed, Hits ignore Enemy Physical Damage Reduction and Cannot be Stunned)', ''),
(424, 'ReminderTextHallowingFlame', '(Attacks made against Enemies affected by Hallowing Flame gain 25% of Physical Damage as Extra Fire Damage.' || char(13) || '
Hallowing Flame is removed once an Attack that benefits from this Damage as Extra is successfully made.' || char(13) || '
Hallowing Flame lasts for six seconds and cannot benefit the one who inflicted it)', ''),
(425, 'ReminderTextUnholyResonance', '(Maximum 50 Unholy Resonance of each type. Unholy Resonance types are Lightning, Physical and Chaos)', ''),
(426, 'ReminderTextBestialRage', '(Bestial Rage increases the Movement Speed, Attack Speed and Damage of the affected Beast)', ''),
(427, 'ReminderTextOverloadedIntensity', '(Maximum of 3 Overloaded Intensity. Gaining Overloaded Intensity refreshes the duration of existing stacks of Overloaded Intensity)', ''),
(428, 'ReminderTextVaalTemptation', '(Vaal Temptation lasts for the duration that Soul Gain Prevention would have applied and can stack)', ''),
(429, 'ReminderTextFlee', '(Magic monsters have 50% chance to avoid fleeing. Rare and Unique monsters cannot flee)', ''),
(430, 'ReminderTextThirstForBlood', '(Thirst for Blood reserves some of your life to cause bleeding you inflict to be stronger, and grant life regeneration based on the number bleeding enemies nearby)', ''),
(431, 'ReminderTextRottenBulwark', '(Rotten Bulwark will take damage from hits before your Life or Energy Shield. Any Hit Damage taken will break your Rotten Bulwark, causing it to absorb up to the amount of Rotten Bulwark you have available.)', ''),
(432, 'ReminderTextShapedRegionCollapse', '(By default, when you complete an objective in a Map within a Shaped Region it collapses, removing itself from the Region. This causes all other Maps in the Region to gain additional modifiers. In cases where the Shaped Region would become bisected, only the Region with the most connected Maps will remain)', ''),
(433, 'ReminderTextKeystoneVoranasAdaption', '(Removes all Energy Shield
Chance to Evade Hits is based off of 200% of your Ward instead of your Evasion Rating
Physical Damage Reduction from Hits is based off of 200% of your Ward instead of your Armour)', ''),
(434, 'ReminderTextKeystoneUhtredsFury', '(While you have Unbroken Ward, your next non-channelling Attack you Use yourself breaks your Ward to gain Added Cold Damage equal to 25% of Ward)', ''),
(435, 'ReminderTextKeystoneMedvedsExchange', '(40% less Ward
Ward has a 60% chance to not Break)', ''),
(436, 'ReminderTextTemplarAura', '(Templar Auras have one of the following effects:' || char(13) || '
- Gain 15% of Physical Damage as Extra Fire Damage' || char(13) || '
- Gain 15% of Physical Damage as Extra Lightning Damage' || char(13) || '
- Regenerate 1.5% of Life per second' || char(13) || '
- 30% increased Mana Regeneration Rate' || char(13) || '
- +23% to Chaos Resistance' || char(13) || '
- 50% reduced Effect of Curses on you)', ''),
(437, 'ReminderTextDisgorge', '(You cannot gain Gluttony while you have Disgorge)', ''),
(438, 'ReminderTextDivinationDrops', '(Having more Divination Cards that can be found in a Map increases the chances for Divination Cards to be found)', ''),
(439, 'ReminderTextAddedDamageGlobal', '(Local Modifiers on Weapons that add damage to that Weapon do not grant you Added Damage, so are unchanged by this)', ''),
(440, 'ReminderTextSkillRepeat', '(Channelling Skills cannot Repeat)', ''),
(441, 'ReminderTextMavenChiselDrops', '(Maven Chisels can only drop if you have the Ceremonial Voidstone socketed in your Atlas)', ''),
(442, 'ReminderTextTwistOfFateRules', '(Cannot modifiy Blighted Maps or Maps behind Voidstone sockets on the Atlas)', ''),
(443, 'ReminderTextSandsOfTimeSkill', '(Creates a Suspended Mirage - an astral-infused clone of yourself that is suspended in time, just before the release of the spellcast that triggered them. On reaching three Suspended Mirages, all Suspended Mirages will be released, using the spell which was cast to create them. Suspended Mirages are not created by Vaal spells, channelling spells, instant spells, or spells which create minions)', ''),
(444, 'ReminderTextMoltenBurstSkill', '(Molten Burst launches molten projectiles from the point of impact, causing area attack damage to enemies where they land)', ''),
(445, 'ReminderTextBrineCharges', '(You gain 4% of Physical Damage as extra Cold Damage and as extra Lightning Damage per Brine Charge
Maximum Brine Charges is equal to Maximum Endurance Charges)', ''),
(446, 'ReminderTextHarbingerOfDirectionsSkill', '(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: Fire 2 additional Projectiles, Chain 2 additional times, Projectiles Pierce 2 additional targets, or Projectiles Fork then Fork an additional time)', ''),
(447, 'ReminderTextTransfusionNearbyMinion', '(Transfusion prioritises your closest Minion that isn''t already at maximum Souls)', ''),
(448, 'ReminderTextHouseCyaxan', '(Mercenaries from House Cyaxan are Witches and Rangers)', ''),
(449, 'ReminderTextHouseAzadi', '(Mercenaries from House Azadi are Duelists and Shadows)', ''),
(450, 'ReminderTextHouseKeita', '(Mercenaries from House Keita are Templars and Marauders)', ''),
(451, 'ReminderTextGhostLanternBuff', '[DNT] (Ghostflame Souls can be collected by being walked over. they last for 10 seconds if not collected. Each Ghostflame Soul grants 1 Ghost Inferno)', ''),
(452, 'ReminderTextArcaneMight', '(Arcane Might causes Increases and Reductions to Spell Damage to also apply to Attack Damage at that percentage of their value)', ''),
(453, 'ReminderTextPermanentMercenary', '(While you have this passive allocated, you will have the option to permanently hire Mercenaries found in the wild. Permanently hired Mercenaries and their Minions deal less Damage than temporarily hired Mercenaries, but you can change what gear they have equipped. Passives that affect your Mercenary do not affect temporarily hired Mercenaries. Permanently hired Mercenaries will only follow Luminaries with this passive allocated)', ''),
(454, 'ReminderTextSocketColourQualityBonus', '(Socketed Gems gain +10% to Quality in Red, Blue and Green Sockets if the Gem colour matches the Socket colour)', ''),
(455, 'ReminderTextColdAilmentsWithChance', '(Cold Ailments are Chilled, Frozen and Brittle. Hits inherently have 100% chance to inflict Chill and Critical Strikes inherently have 100% chance to inflict Freeze)', ''),
(456, 'ReminderTextLightningAilmentsWithChance', '(Lightning Ailments are Shocked and Sapped. Critical Strikes inherently have 100% chance to inflict Shock)', ''),
(457, 'ReminderTextBrineGround', '(Enemies on your Brine Ground have 30% increased effect of Lightning and Cold Ailments on them and have 25% reduced Armour and Evasion Rating. Allies on your Brine Ground gain 10% of Physical Damage as extra Cold Damage and as extra Lightning Damage)', ''),
(458, 'ReminderTextBrineTorrent', '(A torrent rushes upwards after a short delay, dealing damage in an area while leaving Brine Ground)', ''),
(459, 'ReminderTextBrineRotAura', '(30% of Damage over Time taken by Enemies within the Drowning Domain is inflicted as Brine Rot. Enemies lose life equal to stored Brine Rot when they leave the Drowning Domain)', ''),
(460, 'ReminderTextBarnacleDebuff', '(Enemies affected by Barnacles Convert 5% of Physical Damage to Cold and have 5% increased duration of Chill and Freeze on them. Each instance of Barnacles lasts 30 seconds and can be inflicted up to 10 times)', ''),
(461, 'ReminderTextGhostInferno', '(Each Ghost Inferno grants +5% Fire Damage over Time Multiplier. Each Ghost Inferno lasts for 8 seconds. Maximum 10 Ghost Inferno)', ''),
(462, 'ReminderTextKeystonePureElementalist', '(Fire Spells cannot deal non-Fire Damage
Cold Spells cannot deal non-Cold Damage
Lightning Spells cannot deal non-Lightning Damage
Elemental Spells deal 30% more Damage with Ailments and have 30% more Effect of non-Damaging Ailments)', ''),
(463, 'ReminderTextPhysicalThorns', '(Physical Thorns activates when Hit by Physical Damage and lasts for 5 seconds. While active, it reflects Physical Damage each time the monster receives a Physical Hit. Monsters cannot gain Physical Thorns more than once every 10 seconds. You can only take Physical Thorns damage once every 0.1 seconds)', ''),
(464, 'ReminderTextElementalThorns', '(Elemental Thorns activates when Hit by Elemental Damage and lasts for 5 seconds. While active, it reflects Damage each time the monster receives a Elemental Hit, dealing Damage of the highest Elemental Damage type in the received Hit. Monsters cannot gain Elemental Thorns more than once every 10 seconds. You can only take Elemental Thorns damage once every 0.1 seconds)', ''),
(465, 'ReminderTextBifurcatedCriticalStrikes', '[DNT](Critical Strike chance is rolled twice when determining if a Critical Strike should occur' || char(13) || '
If 1/2 rolls succeed the hit will be a Critical Strike, and Critical Strike Multiplier applies as normal' || char(13) || '
If both rolls succeed the hit will be a Critical Strike, and Critical Strike Multiplier bonus twice' || char(13) || '
If a modifier makes your Critical Strike Chance Lucky, that Luck will apply individually to both of these rolls' || char(13) || '
Guaranteed Critical Strikes cannot be Bifurcated (such as Plume of Pursuit or Diamond Shrine))', ''),
(466, 'ReminderTextEmpoweredSpells', '(Vaal Spells and Brand Spells cannot be Empowered)', ''),
(467, 'ReminderTextBloodriteDebuff', '(Hunger of Ghorr gains a Stage every time you cast a different Empowered Spell with Pact of Ghorr, up to a maximum of 3 Stages. Stages are reset back to 0 when you recast Pact of Ghorr )', '');
